@baseUrl = http://localhost:5210
@apiKey = REPLACE_WITH_32_CHARACTER_KEY

### Indicative assessment (fictional data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/eligibility/assess
X-Eligibility-Service-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"propertyValue":300000,"deposit":30000,"annualIncome":100000,"creditCheckConsent":true}

### Invalid input
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/eligibility/assess
X-Eligibility-Service-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"propertyValue":100,"deposit":200,"annualIncome":0,"creditCheckConsent":false}
